# Ship .streamlit/config.toml (the theme) into the image, but never a secrets
# file. Excluding the whole dir stripped the theme, so the deployed app ran with
# no config and native components (charts, data-grid) followed the browser's dark
# mode while our CSS only re-lit the HTML surfaces.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
